WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.840
...thankful that Congressman Jackson
told me about the

00:02.840 --> 00:07.440
Region 17 roundtable meeting for Ghana.

00:07.440 --> 00:10.560
As the only African American woman

00:10.560 --> 00:13.280
manufacturing chocolate at scale,

00:13.280 --> 00:16.840
this is so hopeful and so exciting
about what

00:16.840 --> 00:19.400
entrepreneurs in America can do
to bridge to Ghana.

00:19.400 --> 00:21.280
I cannot wait.
